SceneApplyResult applyFullSceneSnapshot(const ApplyFullSceneSnapshotRequest&) noexcept;
RendererSceneStateSnapshot activeSceneState() const noexcept;
SceneDeltaCounterSnapshot sceneDeltaCounters() const noexcept;
```

The request values are equivalent to:

```cpp
